<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
<title>Subhashis Banerjee</title>
<meta name="description" content="Subhashis Banerjee — Professor, Department of Computer Science, Ashoka University. Research on AI governance, privacy-by-design, electronic voting, and computer vision.">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Source+Serif+4:opsz,wght@8..60,400;8..60,600;8..60,700&family=Inter:wght@400;500;600&family=IBM+Plex+Mono:wght@400;500&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<style>
  :root{
    --bg:#F7F5F0;
    --surface:#FFFFFF;
    --ink:#1C1E22;
    --ink-soft:#565B64;
    --ink-faint:#8A8E96;
    --line:#E2DED2;
    --line-soft:#EDEAE0;
    --accent:#3B5943;
    --accent-soft:#E1E7DE;
    --accent-2:#AD5A2B;
    --accent-2-soft:#F1E1D3;
    --ink-inverse:#F2EFE7;
    --ink-inverse-soft:#C3CCC3;
    --c-privacy:#2C4257;
    --c-tai:#AD5A2B;
    --c-voting:#5C7A99;
    --c-radiology:#71466E;
    --c-vision:#3B5943;
    --sidebar-w:264px;
    --radius:10px;
    --shadow: 0 1px 2px rgba(28,30,34,0.04), 0 8px 24px rgba(28,30,34,0.05);
  }

  *{box-sizing:border-box;}
  html{scroll-behavior:smooth;}
  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce){
    html{scroll-behavior:auto;}
    *{animation-duration:0.01ms !important; animation-iteration-count:1 !important; transition-duration:0.01ms !important;}
  }

  body{
    margin:0;
    background:var(--bg);
    color:var(--ink);
    font-family:'Inter', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, sans-serif;
    font-size:16px;
    line-height:1.6;
    -webkit-font-smoothing:antialiased;
  }

  h1,h2,h3,h4{
    font-family:'Source Serif 4', Georgia, serif;
    font-weight:600;
    line-height:1.2;
    margin:0 0 0.5em;
    color:var(--ink);
  }

  a{color:var(--accent); text-decoration-color: var(--line); text-underline-offset:3px;}
  a:hover{color:var(--accent-2);}
  a:focus-visible, button:focus-visible, summary:focus-visible, input:focus-visible{
    outline:2px solid var(--accent);
    outline-offset:2px;
    border-radius:4px;
  }

  .eyebrow{
    font-family:'IBM Plex Mono', monospace;
    font-size:0.72rem;
    letter-spacing:0.08em;
    text-transform:uppercase;
    color:var(--ink-faint);
  }

  /* ---------- Sidebar ---------- */
  .sidebar{
    position:fixed;
    top:0; left:0; bottom:0;
    width:var(--sidebar-w);
    padding:2rem 1.6rem;
    display:flex;
    flex-direction:column;
    justify-content:space-between;
    border-right:1px solid var(--line);
    background:var(--surface);
    z-index:40;
    overflow-y:auto;
  }
  .sidebar-top{display:flex; flex-direction:column; gap:2rem;}
  .brand{display:flex; align-items:center; gap:0.75rem; text-decoration:none;}
  .brand-mark{
    width:38px; height:38px; border-radius:50%;
    background:var(--accent); color:#fff;
    display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center;
    font-family:'Source Serif 4', serif; font-weight:600; font-size:0.95rem;
    flex-shrink:0;
    object-fit:cover;
    border:1px solid var(--line);
  }
  .brand-text{display:flex; flex-direction:column; line-height:1.25;}
  .brand-name{font-family:'Source Serif 4', serif; font-weight:600; font-size:1rem; color:var(--ink);}
  .brand-role{font-size:0.72rem; color:var(--ink-faint);}

  .nav-list{list-style:none; margin:0; padding:0; display:flex; flex-direction:column; gap:0.15rem;}
  .nav-list a{
    display:block;
    padding:0.5rem 0.6rem;
    border-radius:8px;
    font-size:0.92rem;
    color:var(--ink-soft);
    text-decoration:none;
    border-left:2px solid transparent;
  }
  .nav-list a:hover{background:var(--line-soft); color:var(--ink);}
  .nav-list a.active{
    color:var(--accent);
    background:var(--accent-soft);
    font-weight:500;
  }

  .sidebar-bottom{display:flex; flex-direction:column; gap:0.9rem;}
  .sidebar-links{display:flex; flex-direction:column; gap:0.5rem;}
  .sidebar-links a{
    font-size:0.85rem;
    color:var(--ink-soft);
    text-decoration:none;
    display:flex; align-items:center; gap:0.4rem;
  }
  .sidebar-links a:hover{color:var(--accent);}
  .sidebar-note{font-size:0.75rem; color:var(--ink-faint); border-top:1px solid var(--line); padding-top:0.9rem;}

  .nav-toggle{
    display:none;
    position:fixed; top:1rem; right:1rem; z-index:60;
    width:42px; height:42px; border-radius:50%;
    background:var(--surface); border:1px solid var(--line);
    box-shadow:var(--shadow);
    align-items:center; justify-content:center;
    cursor:pointer;
  }
  .nav-toggle span, .nav-toggle span::before, .nav-toggle span::after{
    content:''; display:block; width:18px; height:2px; background:var(--ink); position:relative; transition:transform .2s ease, opacity .2s ease;
  }
  .nav-toggle span::before{position:absolute; top:-6px;}
  .nav-toggle span::after{position:absolute; top:6px;}
  .nav-toggle.open span{background:transparent;}
  .nav-toggle.open span::before{transform:translateY(6px) rotate(45deg);}
  .nav-toggle.open span::after{transform:translateY(-6px) rotate(-45deg);}

  .scrim{
    display:none;
    position:fixed; inset:0; background:rgba(28,30,34,0.35);
    z-index:35;
  }
  .scrim.show{display:block;}

  /* ---------- Main ---------- */
  main{margin-left:var(--sidebar-w);}

  section, header.hero{
    padding:4.2rem 3.2rem;
    max-width:880px;
  }
  .section-head{margin-bottom:2rem;}
  .section-head .kicker{
    display:block;
    width:34px; height:4px; border-radius:2px;
    background:var(--accent-2);
    margin-bottom:0.9rem;
  }
  .section-head h2{font-size:2rem;}
  .section-head p{color:var(--ink-soft); max-width:60ch; margin:0.35rem 0 0;}

  /* ---------- Hero ---------- */
  header.hero{
    position:relative;
    padding-top:3.6rem;
    padding-bottom:3rem;
    max-width:none;
    overflow:hidden;
    border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);
    background:
      radial-gradient(560px 420px at 88% -10%, var(--accent-soft) 0%, transparent 65%),
      var(--bg);
  }
  .hero-inner{position:relative; z-index:2; max-width:820px;}
  .hero-flex{display:flex; align-items:flex-start; justify-content:space-between; gap:2.5rem;}
  .hero-text{flex:1; min-width:0; max-width:560px;}
  .hero-portrait{
    width:172px; height:172px;
    border-radius:50%;
    object-fit:cover;
    object-position:center 20%;
    border:5px solid var(--surface);
    box-shadow:var(--shadow);
    flex-shrink:0;
    margin-top:0.3rem;
  }
  @media (max-width:760px){
    .hero-flex{flex-direction:column; align-items:flex-start;}
    .hero-portrait{order:-1; width:100px; height:100px; border-width:4px; margin-bottom:0.5rem;}
  }
  .hero-graphic{
    position:absolute;
    top:-40px; right:-60px;
    width:520px; height:420px;
    z-index:1;
    opacity:0.9;
  }
  @media (max-width:900px){ .hero-graphic{opacity:0.35; right:-140px;} }

  .hero-eyebrow{margin-bottom:1rem;}
  h1.hero-name{font-size:clamp(2.3rem, 4.4vw, 3.3rem); margin-bottom:0.3rem;}
  .hero-role{font-size:1.08rem; color:var(--ink-soft); margin-bottom:1.6rem; padding-bottom:1.5rem; border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);}
  .hero-role a{color:var(--ink-soft); font-size:0.95rem;}
  .hero-role a:hover{color:var(--accent-2);}
  .hero-thesis{
    font-family:'Source Serif 4', serif;
    font-size:1.22rem;
    line-height:1.5;
    max-width:52ch;
    color:var(--ink);
    margin-bottom:2rem;
    padding-left:1.1rem;
    border-left:3px solid var(--accent-2);
  }
  .hero-actions{display:flex; flex-wrap:wrap; gap:0.7rem;}
  .btn{
    display:inline-flex; align-items:center; gap:0.4rem;
    padding:0.55rem 1rem;
    border-radius:8px;
    font-size:0.88rem;
    font-weight:500;
    text-decoration:none;
    border:1px solid var(--line);
    background:var(--surface);
    color:var(--ink);
    transition:border-color .15s ease, color .15s ease, background .15s ease;
  }
  .btn:hover{border-color:var(--accent); color:var(--accent); background:var(--accent-soft);}
  .btn-primary{background:var(--accent); color:#fff; border-color:var(--accent);}
  .btn-primary:hover{background:#243549; color:#fff;}

  /* ---------- About ---------- */
  .about-grid{display:grid; grid-template-columns:1fr; gap:2rem;}
  .about-body p{margin:0 0 1.1em; color:var(--ink-soft);}
  .fact-list{
    display:grid; grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr; gap:1.1rem 1.5rem;
    padding:1.3rem 1.5rem;
    background:var(--surface);
    border:1px solid var(--line);
    border-radius:var(--radius);
    margin-top:0.5rem;
  }
  .fact-list div dt{font-family:'IBM Plex Mono', monospace; font-size:0.68rem; text-transform:uppercase; letter-spacing:0.06em; color:var(--ink-faint); margin-bottom:0.25rem;}
  .fact-list div dd{margin:0; font-size:0.92rem; color:var(--ink);}
  @media (max-width:560px){ .fact-list{grid-template-columns:1fr;} }

  /* ---------- Research ---------- */
  .filter-row{display:flex; flex-wrap:wrap; gap:0.5rem; margin-bottom:2rem;}
  .filter-pill{
    font-family:'IBM Plex Mono', monospace;
    font-size:0.74rem;
    padding:0.4rem 0.75rem 0.4rem 0.65rem;
    border-radius:999px;
    border:1px solid var(--line);
    background:var(--surface);
    color:var(--ink-soft);
    text-decoration:none;
    cursor:pointer;
    display:inline-flex;
    align-items:center;
    gap:0.4rem;
  }
  .filter-pill .dot{width:7px; height:7px; border-radius:50%; background:var(--cat-color, var(--ink-faint)); flex-shrink:0;}
  .filter-pill:hover{border-color:var(--cat-color, var(--accent)); color:var(--ink);}

  details.research-card{
    background:var(--surface);
    border:1px solid var(--line);
    border-left:4px solid var(--cat-color, var(--accent));
    border-radius:var(--radius);
    margin-bottom:0.9rem;
    padding:0;
    overflow:hidden;
  }
  details.research-card[open]{border-color:var(--line); border-left-color:var(--cat-color, var(--accent));}
  details.research-card summary{
    list-style:none;
    cursor:pointer;
    padding:1.15rem 1.4rem;
    display:flex;
    align-items:center;
    justify-content:space-between;
    gap:1rem;
  }
  details.research-card summary::-webkit-details-marker{display:none;}
  .summary-text{display:flex; align-items:center; gap:0.6rem;}
  .summary-text .dot{width:9px; height:9px; border-radius:50%; background:var(--cat-color, var(--accent)); flex-shrink:0;}
  .summary-text h3{font-size:1.08rem; margin:0;}
  .chevron{
    flex-shrink:0; width:22px; height:22px; color:var(--ink-faint);
    transition:transform .18s ease;
  }
  details[open] .chevron{transform:rotate(180deg);}

  .research-body{padding:0 1.4rem 1.4rem;}
  .research-blurb{color:var(--ink-soft); font-size:0.94rem; margin:0 0 1.1rem; max-width:64ch;}
  .pub-list{list-style:none; margin:0; padding:0; border-top:1px solid var(--line-soft);}
  .pub-list li{padding:0.85rem 0; border-bottom:1px solid var(--line-soft); font-size:0.92rem;}
  .pub-list li:last-child{border-bottom:none;}
  .pub-title{font-style:italic; color:var(--ink);}
  .pub-meta{display:block; color:var(--ink-faint); font-size:0.82rem; margin-top:0.2rem;}
  .pub-meta a{color:var(--ink-faint);}
  .pub-meta a:hover{color:var(--accent);}

  /* ---------- Courses ---------- */
  .course-grid{display:grid; grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr; gap:2rem;}
  @media (max-width:640px){ .course-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr;} }
  .course-block h3{font-size:0.95rem; text-transform:uppercase; letter-spacing:0.04em; font-family:'IBM Plex Mono', monospace; color:var(--ink-faint); font-weight:500; margin-bottom:0.4rem;}
  .course-semester{font-size:0.85rem; color:var(--accent-2); font-weight:500; margin:0 0 1rem;}
  .current-course{
    padding:0.85rem 0; border-bottom:1px solid var(--line-soft);
    font-size:0.92rem;
  }
  .current-course a{color:var(--ink);}
  .taught-list{columns:1; list-style:none; margin:0; padding:0; column-gap:1.5rem;}
  .taught-list li{
    padding:0.55rem 0; border-bottom:1px solid var(--line-soft);
    font-size:0.92rem; color:var(--ink-soft); break-inside:avoid;
  }

  /* ---------- Commentaries ---------- */
  .search-row{display:flex; gap:0.6rem; margin-bottom:1.6rem;}
  .search-input{
    flex:1;
    padding:0.65rem 0.9rem;
    border-radius:8px;
    border:1px solid var(--line);
    background:var(--surface);
    font-family:'Inter', sans-serif;
    font-size:0.92rem;
    color:var(--ink);
  }
  .search-input:focus{outline:2px solid var(--accent); outline-offset:1px;}
  .commentary-list{list-style:none; margin:0; padding:0;}
  .commentary-item{
    padding:1rem 0;
    border-bottom:1px solid var(--line-soft);
    display:flex; flex-direction:column; gap:0.25rem;
  }
  .commentary-item .c-title{font-style:italic; font-size:0.97rem; color:var(--ink);}
  .commentary-item .c-title a{color:inherit;}
  .commentary-item .c-meta{font-size:0.82rem; color:var(--ink-faint); font-family:'IBM Plex Mono', monospace;}
  .commentary-item .c-meta a{color:var(--ink-faint); font-family:'Inter', sans-serif;}
  .commentary-item .c-meta a:hover{color:var(--accent);}
  .no-results{color:var(--ink-faint); font-size:0.9rem; padding:1rem 0;}
  .load-more-row{margin-top:1.4rem; text-align:center;}

  /* ---------- Contact / Footer ---------- */
  footer.contact{
    background:var(--accent);
    color:var(--ink-inverse);
    padding:4rem 3.2rem 2.6rem;
    max-width:none;
  }
  footer.contact h2{color:#fff;}
  footer.contact .kicker{background:var(--accent-2);}
  footer.contact p{color:var(--ink-inverse-soft);}
  .contact-inner{max-width:880px;}
  .contact-grid{display:flex; flex-wrap:wrap; gap:2.5rem; margin:1.6rem 0 2.2rem;}
  .contact-grid dt{font-family:'IBM Plex Mono', monospace; font-size:0.68rem; text-transform:uppercase; letter-spacing:0.06em; color:var(--ink-inverse-soft); margin-bottom:0.3rem;}
  .contact-grid dd{margin:0; font-size:0.95rem; color:var(--ink-inverse);}
  .contact-grid a{color:#fff; text-decoration-color:rgba(255,255,255,0.4);}
  .contact-grid a:hover{color:var(--accent-2-soft);}
  .footer-note{font-size:0.8rem; color:var(--ink-inverse-soft);}
  .email-row{display:flex; align-items:center; gap:0.7rem; flex-wrap:wrap;}
  .copy-email-btn{
    font-family:'IBM Plex Mono', monospace;
    font-size:0.78rem;
    background:rgba(255,255,255,0.08);
    border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.25);
    color:#fff;
    padding:0.3rem 0.7rem;
    border-radius:6px;
    cursor:pointer;
  }
  .copy-email-btn:hover{background:rgba(255,255,255,0.16);}
  .sidebar .copy-email-btn, .hero .copy-email-btn{
    background:var(--surface);
    border:1px solid var(--line);
    color:var(--ink-soft);
  }
  .sidebar .copy-email-btn:hover, .hero .copy-email-btn:hover{border-color:var(--accent); color:var(--accent);}
  .sidebar .email-row{flex-direction:column; align-items:flex-start; gap:0.35rem;}
  .email-text{font-family:'IBM Plex Mono', monospace; font-size:0.83rem;}

  /* ---------- Responsive ---------- */
  @media (max-width:900px){
    .sidebar{
      transform:translateX(-100%);
      transition:transform .22s ease;
      width:78vw; max-width:300px;
      box-shadow:var(--shadow);
    }
    .sidebar.open{transform:translateX(0);}
    .nav-toggle{display:flex;}
    main{margin-left:0;}
    section, header.hero, footer.contact{padding:3.2rem 1.5rem;}
    .hero{padding-top:5rem;}
  }
</style>
</head>
<body>

  <button class="nav-toggle" id="navToggle" aria-label="Toggle navigation" aria-expanded="false"><span></span></button>
  <div class="scrim" id="scrim"></div>

  <nav class="sidebar" id="sidebar" aria-label="Primary">
    <div class="sidebar-top">
      <a href="#top" class="brand">
        <img class="brand-mark" src="photo-thumb.jpg" alt="Subhashis Banerjee">
        <span class="brand-text">
          <span class="brand-name">Subhashis Banerjee</span>
          <span class="brand-role">Ashoka University</span>
        </span>
      </a>
      <ul class="nav-list" id="navList">
        <li><a href="#about" data-nav>About</a></li>
        <li><a href="#research" data-nav>Research</a></li>
        <li><a href="#courses" data-nav>Courses</a></li>
        <li><a href="#commentaries" data-nav>Commentaries</a></li>
        <li><a href="#contact" data-nav>Contact</a></li>
      </ul>
    </div>
    <div class="sidebar-bottom">
      <div class="sidebar-links">
        <div class="email-row">
          <span class="email-text" data-email-slot></span>
          <button class="copy-email-btn" data-copy-email type="button">Copy email</button>
        </div>
        <a href="https://www.ashoka.edu.in/profile/subhashis-banerjee/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Ashoka profile ↗</a>
        <a href="https://subhashis-banerjee.in/cv.pdf" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Biodata (CV) ↗</a>
      </div>
      <p class="sidebar-note">Department of Computer Science, Ashoka University · Sonipat, Haryana</p>
    </div>
  </nav>

  <main>
    <header class="hero" id="top">
      <svg class="hero-graphic" viewBox="0 0 520 420" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" aria-hidden="true">
        <g stroke="#3B5943" stroke-width="1" opacity="0.5">
          <line x1="60" y1="90" x2="200" y2="40"/>
          <line x1="200" y1="40" x2="360" y2="80"/>
          <line x1="200" y1="40" x2="180" y2="180"/>
          <line x1="360" y1="80" x2="440" y2="200"/>
          <line x1="180" y1="180" x2="360" y2="80"/>
          <line x1="180" y1="180" x2="120" y2="290"/>
          <line x1="180" y1="180" x2="320" y2="260"/>
          <line x1="320" y1="260" x2="440" y2="200"/>
          <line x1="320" y1="260" x2="260" y2="370"/>
          <line x1="120" y1="290" x2="260" y2="370"/>
          <line x1="60" y1="90" x2="30" y2="220"/>
          <line x1="30" y1="220" x2="120" y2="290"/>
        </g>
        <g fill="#3B5943">
          <circle cx="60" cy="90" r="4.5"/>
          <circle cx="200" cy="40" r="4.5"/>
          <circle cx="360" cy="80" r="5.5"/>
          <circle cx="180" cy="180" r="6.5"/>
          <circle cx="440" cy="200" r="4.5"/>
          <circle cx="120" cy="290" r="4.5"/>
          <circle cx="320" cy="260" r="5.5"/>
          <circle cx="30" cy="220" r="3.5"/>
          <circle cx="260" cy="370" r="4.5"/>
        </g>
      </svg>
      <div class="hero-inner">
        <div class="hero-flex">
          <div class="hero-text">
            <p class="eyebrow hero-eyebrow">Computer Science · AI Governance · Privacy</p>
            <h1 class="hero-name">Subhashis Banerjee</h1>
            <p class="hero-role">Professor, <a href="https://www.ashoka.edu.in/department/department-of-cs/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Department of Computer Science</a> · <a href="https://www.ashoka.edu.in" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Ashoka University</a><br><a href="https://www.ashoka.edu.in/page/centre-for-digitalisation-ai-and-society/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Centre for Digitalisation, AI, and Society</a></p>
            <p class="hero-thesis">Working on verifiable architectures for privacy, security, safety, and proportionality analysis of large public-service digital and AI systems; trustworthy AI; computer vision and machine learning.</p>
            <div class="hero-actions">
              <a class="btn btn-primary" href="#research">See research →</a>
              <a class="btn" href="https://subhashis-banerjee.in/cv.pdf" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Download CV</a>
              <button class="copy-email-btn" data-copy-email type="button">Copy email</button>
            </div>
          </div>
          <img class="hero-portrait" src="photo.jpg" alt="Subhashis Banerjee">
        </div>
      </div>
    </header>

    <!-- ABOUT -->
    <section id="about">
      <div class="section-head">
        <span class="kicker" aria-hidden="true"></span>
        <h2>About</h2>
      </div>
      <div class="about-grid">
        <div class="about-body">
          <p>Subhashis Banerjee is a professor of computer science at Ashoka University, Sonipat, India.</p>
          <p>He was with the Department of Computer Science and Engineering at IIT Delhi from 1990 till August 2023 — on leave at Ashoka University from June 2021 to May 2023 before moving there permanently. At IIT Delhi he held the Ministry of Urban Development, Microsoft, and Naren Gupta chair professorships; headed the Department of Computer Science between 2004–2007 and the Computer Services Centre between 2009–2014; and was associated with the School of Public Policy and the Centre for Transportation Research and Injury Prevention.</p>
          <p>His primary research areas are computer vision and machine learning, with a particular emphasis on geometric algorithms. He has served on the editorial boards of the <em>International Journal of Computer Vision</em> and <em>Computers &amp; Graphics</em>, and has been an academic visitor to universities and research laboratories around the world. He has also worked extensively on computing and networking infrastructure, building one of the country's largest supercomputing facilities at IIT Delhi.</p>
          <p>More recently, his interests have turned to policy questions in digitalisation and society — digital identity, electronic voting, data and privacy protection, and the fairness and reliability of machine learning systems.</p>
